## XAML / Avalonia (WPF, UWP, MAUI) — VS Dark+ (Smax)
syntax xaml "\.a?xaml$"

## Processing instructions / declaration
color #888 "<\?[^?]*\?>"
## CDATA sections
color #6a5 start="<!\[CDATA\[" end="\]\]>"

## Tag delimiters
color #888 "</?|/?>"
## Tag names (incl. Foo.Bar attached-property syntax)
color #59c "</?[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_:.-]*"
## Attribute names (incl. x:, xmlns:, attached props)
color #9df "[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_:.-]*="
## Attribute values / strings
color #c97 ""[^"]*"|'[^']*'"

## Markup extensions  {Binding ...}  {StaticResource ...}  {x:Type ...}
color #4cb "\{/?[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9:.]* ?[^{}]*\}"
## Entities
color #dda "&[A-Za-z#][A-Za-z0-9]*;"

## Comments
color #6a5 start="<!--" end="-->"
